      "text": "because of what he sees, Lehi1 quakes and trembles, 1 Ne. 1:6. many cities to tumble to earth because of quaking, 1 Ne. 12:4. all who belong to kingdom of devil need quake, 1 Ne. 22:23. the Lord has confounded mine enemies, causing them to quake, 2 Ne. 4:22. thought that any soul should endure endless torment causes sons of Mosiah2 to quake, Mosiah 28:3. at the Lord’s voice hills and mountains quake, Hel. 12:9. whole face of land is changed because of great quaking of whole earth, 3 Ne. 8:12. small voice pierces to center, that no part of frame does not quake, 3 Ne. 11:3.",
